# starhermit game --render-check --script tests/native.play
ready
expect Cast off
save title
click Cast off
expect CHAPTER 01
save introduction
click Take to the water
expect A river full of letters
save river
key KeyD 90
key KeyJ 1
expect LETTERS FROM THE RIVER
save journal
click Close
key Escape 1
expect A moment on the bank
save pause
click Return to the water
expect A river full of letters
